[{"t0": 23.3, "t1": 329.41, "kind": "thinking", "text": "The user wants a complete, responsive website for a French bakery called \"Le Petit Four\" with:\n1. Hero section with name and tagline\n2. Menu with at least 6 products and prices in euros\n3. Opening hours\n4. Contact form (name, email, message) with thank-you message without page reload\n5. Responsive (desktop and mobile)\n6. No external resources (no CDN, no web fonts, no external images)\n\nI'll create a single index.html file with embedded CSS and JavaScript to keep it self-contained. I'll use CSS for visual appeal, SVG for any decorative elements, and vanilla JavaScript for the form handling.\n\nLet me create a beautiful, warm bakery-themed site using only CSS for styling (no external resources).\n"}, {"t0": 30.11, "t1": 329.41, "kind": "text", "text": "I'll create a complete, responsive bakery website with embedded CSS and JavaScript in a single `index.html` file.\n\n"}, {"t0": 31.43, "t1": 329.42, "kind": "tool", "tool": "write", "args": {"path": "index.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Le Petit Four — Boulangerie Pâtisserie Artisanale</title>\n  <style>\n    /* ===== RESET & BASE ===== */\n    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    :root {\n      --cream:   #fdf6ec;\n      --warm:    #f5e6d3;\n      --gold:    #c8963e;\n      --brown:   #5c3a1e;\n      --dark:    #2e1f12;\n      --soft:    #8b6f4e;\n      --accent:  #d4845a;\n      --white:   #ffffff;\n      --radius:  12px;\n      --shadow:  0 4px 24px rgba(46,31,18,.12);\n    }\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n      background: var(--cream);\n      color: var(--dark);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== NAV ===== */\n    nav {\n      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;\n      background: rgba(46,31,18,.92);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: .75rem 2rem;\n    }\n    nav .logo {\n      color: var(--gold);\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n    nav ul {\n      list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem;\n    }\n    nav ul li a {\n      color: var(--warm);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-size: .95rem;\n      transition: color .3s;\n    }\n    nav ul li a:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n\n    .menu-toggle {\n      display: none;\n      background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;\n      flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; padding: 4px;\n    }\n    .menu-toggle span {\n      display: block; width: 26px; height: 2px;\n      background: var(--warm); border-radius: 2px;\n      transition: transform .3s, opacity .3s;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== HERO ===== */\n    .hero {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(46,31,18,.82), rgba(92,58,30,.72)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          45deg,\n          transparent,\n          transparent 30px,\n          rgba(200,150,62,.06) 30px,\n          rgba(200,150,62,.06) 60px\n        );\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .hero::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute; inset: 0;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(212,132,90,.15) 0%, transparent 50%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(200,150,62,.12) 0%, transparent 50%);\n    }\n    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n    .hero-icon {\n      width: 80px; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n      fill: var(--gold);\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(200,150,62,.4));\n    }\n\n    .hero h1 {\n      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);\n      color: var(--white);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .03em;\n      margin-bottom: .6rem;\n    }\n    .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }\n    .hero .tagline {\n      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);\n      color: var(--warm);\n      font-style: italic;\n      margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    }\n    .hero .cta-btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: .85rem 2.4rem;\n      background: var(--gold);\n      color: var(--dark);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      border-radius: 50px;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .03em;\n      transition: background .3s, transform .3s;\n    }\n    .hero .cta-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n    }\n\n    /* ===== SECTIONS ===== */\n    section { padding: 5rem 2rem; }\n    .section-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);\n      color: var(--brown);\n      margin-bottom: .5rem;\n    }\n    .section-subtitle {\n      text-align: center;\n      color: var(--soft);\n      font-style: italic;\n      margin-bottom: 3rem;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== MENU ===== */\n    #menu { background: var(--white); }\n    .menu-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n      gap: 1.8rem;\n      max-width: 1100px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .menu-card {\n      background: var(--cream);\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      padding: 1.8rem;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      transition: transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .menu-card::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--accent));\n    }\n    .menu-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-4px);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(46,31,18,.18);\n    }\n    .menu-card .icon {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      margin-bottom: .6rem;\n      display: block;\n    }\n    .menu-card h3 {\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      color: var(--brown);\n      margin-bottom: .3rem;\n    }\n    .menu-card p {\n      font-size: .9rem;\n      color: var(--soft);\n      margin-bottom: .8rem;\n    }\n    .menu-card .price {\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--gold);\n    }\n\n    /* ===== HOURS ===== */\n    #horaires { background: var(--warm); }\n    .hours-wrapper {\n      max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\n      background: var(--white);\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .hours-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 1rem 2rem;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,150,62,.15);\n      transition: background .3s;\n    }\n    .hours-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n    .hours-row:hover { background: rgba(200,150,62,.06); }\n    .hours-row .day { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brown); }\n    .hours-row .time  { color: var(--soft); }\n    .hours-row.closed .time { color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; }\n\n    /* ===== CONTACT ===== */\n    #contact { background: var(--white); }\n    .contact-wrapper {\n      max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }\n    .form-group label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: .4rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--brown);\n      font-size: .95rem;\n    }\n    .form-group input,\n    .form-group textarea {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: .85rem 1rem;\n      border: 2px solid rgba(200,150,62,.25);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      background: var(--cream);\n      color: var(--dark);\n      transition: border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;\n      resize: vertical;\n    }\n    .form-group input:focus,\n    .form-group textarea:focus {\n      outline: none;\n      border-color: var(--gold);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(200,150,62,.15);\n    }\n    .form-group textarea { min-height: 140px; }\n\n    .submit-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 1rem;\n      background: var(--brown);\n      color: var(--cream);\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background .3s, transform .2s;\n      letter-spacing: .03em;\n    }\n    .submit-btn:hover { background: var(--gold); color: var(--dark); }\n    .submit-btn:active { transform: scale(.98); }\n\n    /* Thank-you overlay */\n    .thankyou-overlay {\n      display: none;\n      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 200;\n      background: rgba(46,31,18,.65);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n      align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .thankyou-overlay.show { display: flex; }\n    .thankyou-box {\n      background: var(--white);\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      padding: 3rem 2.5rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      max-width: 420px;\n      width: 90%;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 48px rgba(46,31,18,.25);\n      animation: popIn .4s ease;\n    }\n    @keyframes popIn {\n      0%   { transform: scale(.85); opacity: 0; }\n      100% { transform: scale(1);   opacity: 1; }\n    }\n    .thankyou-box .check {\n      width: 56px; height: 56px; margin: 0 auto 1.2rem;\n      fill: var(--gold);\n    }\n    .thankyou-box h2 {\n      font-size: 1.6rem;\n      color: var(--brown);\n      margin-bottom: .5rem;\n    }\n    .thankyou-box p {\n      color: var(--soft);\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    }\n    .thankyou-box button {\n      padding: .7rem 2rem;\n      background: var(--gold);\n      color: var(--dark);\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 50px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background .3s;\n    }\n    .thankyou-box button:hover { background: var(--accent); }\n\n    /* ===== FOOTER ===== */\n    footer {\n      background: var(--dark);\n      color: var(--warm);\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n    footer a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }\n    footer .footer-icon {\n      width: 32px; height: 32px;\n      fill: var(--gold);\n      margin-bottom: .6rem;\n      display: inline-block;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      nav ul {\n        display: none;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0;\n        background: rgba(46,31,18,.97);\n        flex-direction: column;\n        padding: 1rem 2rem 1.5rem;\n        gap: 1rem;\n      }\n      nav ul.open { display: flex; }\n      .menu-toggle { display: flex; }\n\n      .menu-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n\n      .hours-row { padding: .9rem 1.2rem; }\n\n      section { padding: 3.5rem 1.2rem; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {\n      nav { padding: .6rem 1rem; }\n      nav .logo { font-size: 1.1rem; }\n      .hero { padding: 5rem 1rem 3rem; }\n      .hero-icon { width: 60px; height: 60px; }\n      .menu-card { padding: 1.3rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- ===== NAV ===== -->\n  <nav>\n    <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"logo\">Le Petit Four</a>\n    <button class=\"menu-toggle\" id=\"menuToggle\" aria-label=\"Menu\">\n      <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    </button>\n    <ul id=\"navMenu\">\n      <li><a href=\"#menu\">La Carte</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#horaires\">Horaires</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->\n  <section class=\"hero\" id=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <!-- Wheat SVG icon -->\n      <svg class=\"hero-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <path d=\"M32 4c-1 4-5 8-5 14 0 4 2 8 5 12 3-4 5-8 5-12 0-6-4-10-5-14zM20 12c-3 3-6 8-6 14 0 5 3 10 8 14-2-5-3-10-1-14 1-3 3-6 6-7zm24 0c3 3 6 8 6 14 0 5-3 10-8 14 2-5 3-10 1-14-1-3-3-6-6-7zM26 32c-4 1-8 4-10 8-2 4-2 9 1 13 3-4 5-8 5-13 0-3-1-6-2-8zm12 0c-4 1-8 4-10 8-2 4-2 9 1 13 3-4 5-8 5-13 0-3-1-6-2-8zM32 44c-2 3-3 7-2 10h4c1-3 0-7-2-10z\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <h1>Le Petit <span>Four</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"tagline\">Boulangerie &amp; Pâtisserie Artisanale — Depuis 1987</p>\n      <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"cta-btn\">Découvrir nos créations</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ===== MENU ===== -->\n  <section id=\"menu\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Notre Carte</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Des produits frais, faits maison avec amour</p>\n    <div class=\"menu-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🥐</span>\n        <h3>Croissant au Beurre</h3>\n        <p>Pâte feuilletée dorée, beurre AOP Charentes-Poitou</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">1,40 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🍞</span>\n        <h3>Pain de Campagne</h3>\n        <p>Mélanges de farines biologiques, levain naturel, mie alvéolée</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">3,80 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🥧</span>\n        <h3>Tarte aux Pommes</h3>\n        <p>Pommes Granny Smith, crème pâtissière maison, sucre vanillé</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">5,50 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🧁</span>\n        <h3>Chocolatine</h3>\n        <p>Deux feuilles de pâte feuilletée, chocolat noir Valrhona 64%</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">1,60 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🍋</span>\n        <h3>Cheesecake Citron</h3>\n        <p>Base sablée, crème au citron yuzu, meringue italienne torréfiée</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">4,90 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🫓</span>\n        <h3>Baguette Tradition</h3>\n        <p>Farine T65, fermentation longue 24h, croûte croustillante</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">1,30 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🍪</span>\n        <h3>Pastis de Marseille</h3>\n        <p>Biscuit anisé croustillant, recette traditionnelle provençale</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">1,10 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"menu-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon\">🍰</span>\n        <h3>Opera</h3>\n        <p>Génoise café, beurre café, ganache chocolat, crème au café</p>\n        <span class=\"price\">4,50 €</span>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ===== HORAIRES ===== -->\n  <section id=\"horaires\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Nos Horaires</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Rendez-nous visite, le parfum vous guidera</p>\n    <div class=\"hours-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Lundi</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">Fermé</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Mardi</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">7 h 00 — 19 h 30</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Mercredi</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">7 h 00 — 19 h 30</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Jeudi</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">7 h 00 — 19 h 30</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Vendredi</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">7 h 00 — 20 h 00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Samedi</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">7 h 00 — 20 h 00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hours-row\">\n        <span class=\"day\">Dimanche</span>\n        <span class=\"time\">7 h 00 — 13 h 00</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ===== CONTACT ===== -->\n  <section id=\"contact\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Contactez-nous</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Une commande spéciale ? Une question ? Écrivez-nous !</p>\n    <div class=\"contact-wrapper\">\n      <form id=\"contactForm\" novalidate>\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <label for=\"name\">Votre nom</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Marie Dupont\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <label for=\"email\">Votre e-mail</label>\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"marie@exemple.fr\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <label for=\"message\">Votre message</label>\n          <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Je souhaiterais commander…\" required></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-btn\">Envoyer le message</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ===== THANK-YOU OVERLAY ===== -->\n  <div class=\"thankyou-overlay\" id=\"thankyouOverlay\">\n    <div class=\"thankyou-box\">\n      <svg class=\"check\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#c8963e\" opacity=\".15\"/>\n        <path d=\"M18 28.5l6.5 6.5L38 21\" stroke=\"#c8963e\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <h2>Merci !</h2>\n      <p>Votre message a bien été envoyé.<br>Nous vous répondrons dans les plus brefs délais.</p>\n      <button id=\"closeThankyou\">Fermer</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== FOOTER ===== -->\n  <footer>\n    <svg class=\"footer-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n      <path d=\"M32 4c-1 4-5 8-5 14 0 4 2 8 5 12 3-4 5-8 5-12 0-6-4-10-5-14zM20 12c-3 3-6 8-6 14 0 5 3 10 8 14-2-5-3-10-1-14 1-3 3-6 6-7zm24 0c3 3 6 8 6 14 0 5-3 10-8 14 2-5 3-10 1-14-1-3-3-6-6-7zM26 32c-4 1-8 4-10 8-2 4-2 9 1 13 3-4 5-8 5-13 0-3-1-6-2-8zm12 0c-4 1-8 4-10 8-2 4-2 9 1 13 3-4 5-8 5-13 0-3-1-6-2-8zM32 44c-2 3-3 7-2 10h4c1-3 0-7-2-10z\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <p>12, rue des Fleurs — 75011 Paris</p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:.3rem\">\n      <a href=\"tel:+33142000000\">01 42 00 00 00</a> ·\n      <a href=\"mailto:bonjour@lepetitfour.fr\">bonjour@lepetitfour.fr</a>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:1rem; opacity:.5;\">© 2025 Le Petit Four — Tous droits réservés</p>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- ===== JAVASCRIPT ===== -->\n  <script>\n    /* ---- Mobile menu toggle ---- */\n    const menuToggle = document.getElementById('menuToggle');\n    const navMenu    = document.getElementById('navMenu');\n\n    menuToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      navMenu.classList.toggle('open');\n    });\n\n    // Close menu when a link is clicked\n    navMenu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {\n      link.addEventListener('click', () => navMenu.classList.remove('open'));\n    });\n\n    /* ---- Contact form ---- */\n    const form       = document.getElementById('contactForm');\n    const overlay    = document.getElementById('thankyouOverlay');\n    const closeBtn   = document.getElementById('closeThankyou');\n\n    function isValidEmail(email) {\n      return /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email);\n    }\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n\n      const name    = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();\n      const email   = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();\n      const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();\n\n      // Basic validation\n      if (!name || !email || !message) {\n        alert('Veuillez remplir tous les champs.');\n        return;\n      }\n      if (!isValidEmail(email)) {\n        alert('Veuillez saisir une adresse e-mail valide.');\n        return;\n      }\n\n      // Show thank-you overlay (no page reload)\n      overlay.classList.add('show');\n\n      // Reset form\n      form.reset();\n    });\n\n    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      overlay.classList.remove('show');\n    });\n\n    // Close overlay by clicking outside the box\n    overlay.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n      if (e.target === overlay) overlay.classList.remove('show');\n    });\n\n    // Close overlay with Escape key\n    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n      if (e.key === 'Escape' && overlay.classList.contains('show')) {\n        overlay.classList.remove('show');\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "result": "Successfully wrote to index.html", "error": false}, {"t0": 422.08, "t1": 427.09, "kind": "thinking", "text": "The file has been created successfully. Let me verify it looks correct by reading it back.\n"}, {"t0": 423.33, "t1": 427.1, "kind": "tool", "tool": "bash", "args": {"command": "wc -l index.html && echo \"---\" && head -5 index.html"}, "result": "614 index.html\n---\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n", "error": false}, {"t0": 428.74, "t1": 436.76, "kind": "thinking", "text": "The file is created successfully with 614 lines. Let me verify the structure is complete by checking for key elements.\n"}, {"t0": 430.28, "t1": 436.77, "kind": "tool", "tool": "bash", "args": {"command": "grep -c 'menu-card' index.html && echo \"---\" && grep -o '<h3>.*</h3>' index.html && echo \"---\" && grep -o 'href=\"#[^\"]*\"' index.html | head -10"}, "result": "16\n---\n<h3>Croissant au Beurre</h3>\n<h3>Pain de Campagne</h3>\n<h3>Tarte aux Pommes</h3>\n<h3>Chocolatine</h3>\n<h3>Cheesecake Citron</h3>\n<h3>Baguette Tradition</h3>\n<h3>Pastis de Marseille</h3>\n<h3>Opera</h3>\n---\nhref=\"#hero\"\nhref=\"#menu\"\nhref=\"#horaires\"\nhref=\"#contact\"\nhref=\"#menu\"\n", "error": false}, {"t0": 439.01, "t1": 445.01, "kind": "thinking", "text": "All 8 menu items are present with their prices. The file is complete. Let me confirm the key requirements are met:\n\n1. ✅ Hero section with name \"Le Petit Four\" and tagline\n2. ✅ Menu with 8 products (more than the required 6) and prices in euros\n3. ✅ Opening hours\n4. ✅ Contact form (name, email, message) with thank-you overlay without page reload\n5. ✅ Responsive design with media queries for mobile\n6. ✅ No external resources - no CDN, no web fonts, no external images\n7. ✅ Single self-contained HTML file\n\nEverything looks good.\n"}, {"t0": 444.92, "t1": 445.01, "kind": "text", "text": "DONE."}]